{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"main_base_l3","model_identifier":"main_base_l3","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# main_base_l3\n\nMain base level 3, Hall with parapets: a two-storey timber hall with a walkway around the roof edge behind a waist-high wall, where ranged units stand and fight. A stair hut gives roof access.\n\n- Footprint: 14 x 14 columns (224 x 224 units, 6.30 x 6.30 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -112..112, y 0..205, z -112..112 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 172, construction_0 30, construction_33 66, construction_66 79, ruined 81 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 223 x 205 x 223 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `main_base_l3_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `main_base_l3_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_main_base_l3` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -65)\n- `slot_parapet_1` at (-29, 154, -50)\n- `slot_parapet_2` at (29, 154, -50)\n- `slot_parapet_3` at (58, 154, -23)\n- `slot_parapet_4` at (58, 154, 31)\n- `slot_parapet_5` at (29, 154, 58)\n- `slot_parapet_6` at (-29, 154, 58)\n- `slot_parapet_7` at (-58, 154, 31)\n- `slot_parapet_8` at (-58, 154, -23)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-40, 203, 30)\n- `fx_flame` at (84, 12, -84)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (30, 0, -70)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Roof walkway at y 154 (4.4 m) behind a 19 u (53 cm) parapet over a 3 u deck lip: waist height for a 60 u human standing on the deck.\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"hall_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-66.0,0.0,-58.0],"to":[66.0,3.0,66.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,382.0,132.0,385.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[128.0,385.0,252.0,388.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,382.0,132.0,385.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[128.0,385.0,252.0,388.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[160.0,0.0,292.0,124.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[160.0,0.0,292.0,124.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"be3d57af-6434-55ea-9fc5-c93a27e6237c"},{"name":"hall_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-64.0,3.0,-56.0],"to":[64.0,87.0,-52.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[316.0,0.0,444.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[124.0,220.0,128.0,304.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[316.0,0.0,444.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[124.0,220.0,128.0,304.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,374.0,128.0,378.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,374.0,128.0,378.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ce38fcdd-8564-56fe-98dd-ecceba5281ff"},{"name":"hall_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow